From ade6655dd03330751762dc4482a5cb30d3bc57b8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 13:12:31 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] AI receptionist (Vapi): call log, booking and missed-call
 text-back

- Connect a Vapi assistant with its private key and dashboard link. The
  assistant keeps its voice and prompt; this platform adds sun_* tools and
  a per-agent authenticated webhook, and restores them on disconnect.
- Tools: answers from approved knowledge only, open times and booking into
  the business's calendar (re-checked, no double booking), messages as
  high-priority call-back tasks, optional transfer to a person.
- Calls page: every call with outcome, summary, transcript and recording;
  mark done and add notes. Unknown callers become contacts; calls go on the
  contact timeline and start "Phone call ended" automations.
- Missed-call text-back: one transactional text per missed call through the
  compliance gate (a call counts like an inbound text for 24 hours).
- Home shows callers who need a call back; the AI assistant can list calls.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
